  "title": "Alpha Tau Registers for Dual Listing on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange (TASE)",
  "summary": "Jerusalem, August 10, 2026 — Alpha Tau Medical Ltd. (Nasdaq: DRTS, DRTSW) (“Alpha Tau” or the “Company”), the developer of the innovative alpha-radiation cancer therapy Alpha DaRT®, today announced its intention to offer its ordinary shares on the Tel Aviv Stock Exchange and to become dual-listed for trade on both the Nasdaq and TASE markets. […]",
